<view class="ew-page ew-screen" style="font-size:{{fontBase * fontScale}}px"><view class="ew-heading">数据同步</view><view class="ew-subtitle">每条草稿确认后保存，遇到失败或冲突会停止。</view><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="ew-error">{{errorMessage}}</view><view class="ew-section-title">当前餐工作区草稿 {{workspaceDrafts.length}} 条</view><view wx:for="{{workspaceDrafts}}" wx:key="index" class="ew-card"><view class="ew-title">{{item.date}} {{item.mealName}}</view><view class="ew-muted">{{item.label}}</view><ui-button label="查看并重试本餐" variant="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bind:action="onWorkspaceDraft" /></view><view class="ew-card"><view class="ew-title">购物草稿 {{shoppingDraftCount}} 项</view><view class="ew-muted">网络失败的采购操作可查看原内容、重试或重新确认。</view><ui-button label="查看购物草稿" variant="secondary" bind:action="onShoppingDrafts" /></view><view class="ew-section-title">历史本机安排草稿 {{pendingSync.length}} 条</view><ui-state wx:if="{{!pendingSync.length}}" kind="empty" title="没有待确认的安排草稿" description="已确认的计划和实际用餐会通过各页面读取云端数据。" /><view wx:for="{{pendingSync}}" wx:key="index" class="ew-card"><view class="ew-title">{{item.date}} {{item.mealName}}</view><view>{{item.record.name}}</view><ui-status label="仅本机 · 待确认" tone="warning" /></view><ui-button wx:if="{{pendingSync.length}}" label="逐条确认并同步" loading="{{syncing}}" bind:action="syncData" /><view wx:if="{{syncResult.success || syncResult.failed}}" class="ew-notice">已确认保存 {{syncResult.success}} 条 · 失败 {{syncResult.failed}} 条</view><button class="ew-hit-target ew-link" disabled="{{syncing}}" bindtap="clearSyncedData">清理已确认的本机副本</button></view>
